"📷", "Photos & Camera",
		"The camera is only on while you're on the capture screen. Photos are saved into Captry's own sandboxed storage on your device.\n\nCaptry never writes to your iPhone Photos library, never shares photos with other apps, and never uploads them to a server. The Mirror Selfies setting only changes how front-camera photos look — nothing leaves the device."],
	["👤", "Account Data",
		"If you create an account, we store:\n• Your email address — so you can log in and reset your password\n• A username you choose — used as your handle inside the app\n• An anonymous account ID issued by our auth provider\n\nWe use Firebase Authentication and Firestore (both Google) for sign-in and to keep usernames unique. Firebase's handling of this data is governed by Google's privacy policy."],
	["📡", "What We Send To Our Servers",
		"Only the data above (email, username, account ID, and the date you joined).\n\nWe do not send: your photos, your location, your contacts, your device identifiers, your usage activity, or anything else."],
	["🚫", "What We Don't Do",
		"• We don't sell or rent your data — to anyone, ever.\n• We don't use your photos to train AI.\n• We don't track you across other apps or websites.\n• We don't show ads.\n• We don't share data with advertisers, data brokers, or analytics companies."],
	["🔒", "Storage & Security",
		"Photos live in Captry's app sandbox on your iPhone. Other apps cannot read them. iOS encrypts that storage with your device passcode.\n\nAccount data on our servers is protected by TLS in transit and at-rest encryption. We have no ability to view the photos you capture — only you do."],
	["🧒", "Children's Privacy",
		"Captry is not directed at children under 13. We don't knowingly collect data from anyone under 13. If we discover we have, we will delete it."],
	["🗑", "Deleting Your Data",
		"Tap Delete All Data in Profile to wipe everything on your device — photos, collections, and the account record kept locally.\n\nTo also remove your account from our servers, sign in and email us at the address below. We'll permanently delete your account and all server-side data within 30 days."],
	["✏️", "Changes To This Policy",
		"If we change anything material, you'll see a notice in the app before you continue. The date at the top of this screen is always the most recent revision."],
